    "notes": {
        "9b6c24a9-94b8-41f5-8170-22f4fbb2a0e2": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 32,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## ⚠️ Test data assumption\n\n- NewTicket and NewCompany are polling triggers: they emit records created after the flow started, checked on every tick of the instance, so AfterAll waits up to 7 minutes.\n- The 1 minute Wait before the provoking CreateTicket / CreateCompany must stay: it keeps the new records clearly after the trigger's start time.\n- Nobody else may create tickets in pipeline `0` or companies in the portal during the run — the triggers would fire for those too and the Asserts expect the E2E names.\n- Cleanup deletes the ticket (MakeApiCall) and the company using the triggers' output, so it also proves the triggers fired."
        }
